{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"You feel pulled back into your body.  He doesn't fill you with water and kelp, instead your wounds fill themselves out.\n\nAs your brain heals itself, You have flashes of memories.  Making a deal to serve someone to remove a memory.  That memory comes back...","created_at":"2021-08-08T14:58:55.483000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873943365773824070","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"You are just outside a cabin, in a forest.  You couldnt be much older than 15.  You are playing with your 2 year old sister.  Your parents are in town getting supplies.\n\nYou went inside to make some food.  You couldn't have been in there more than a minute right?\n\nYou hear crying, you hear barking.  You don't have dogs.  You grab the gun.  You go out the front door.  Coyotes.  3 of them.  getting ready to attack your baby sister.\n\n**BLAM** you fire the gun.  You haven't really shot one before.  The dogs run off.  You missed them.\n\nYou sister is silent.  **Dead** silent.  You shot her.  you panic.  That memory fades.\n\nNext thing you remember is running through the forest.  Did you tell your parents, or run before you could?  You don't quite remember.","created_at":"2021-08-08T15:04:27.425000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873944758039490650","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
