{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Java Jeeves rides through the city streets like he's done every morning since that tragic day that left him without a prime directive. He dismounts the War Bard's Chariot and ties up Heehaw to the hitching post at the entrance to the cemetery. \nEntering the grounds, JJ walks up solemnly to a pair of headstones and places two fancy cappuccinos each with a rosette of whipped cream and a light dusting of cinnamon. With a bowed head, he recites a poem...\n\n```class _is{ static object Of, My, thought,\nI; float in_memories, across,`\nThe; long and; short the, warm, And, cold;\nmetric expression, of, my_world,\n\nmy; static void\nMain(){thought = I; long _for;\n_is hidden, in_the_past,\nembedded, In, My;}class\n\nAs{long _as, memories, remain;\ndouble will, the pain,\nand no_one; _is to_blame(){\nif(true); _is what, i, hail, _,\nlife; _ = new _is(); for (; ; ) { } return _; }}}```\n\nHe sighs a breathless sigh and stays a moment to contemplate existence and life, death, the world and everything. He whispers to himself a prayer in binary.\n`01100110 01101111 01110010 01110100 01111001 00100000 01110100 01110111 01101111`","created_at":"2021-08-14T16:58:57.896000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876147902077087796","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
